  "observations": {
    "raptor": "Two strong biomechanical legs and smaller mechanical blade forelimbs, pointed forward central shell, red optics, mounted dorsal pod visible. The front of the selected pod reads FOUR openings in2x2 in fine frames80.6 and81.12. Six was an initial mistaken projection assumption; V2 enforces unsupported six and is held. Different rectangular gun mount at82s is not imported into selected pod variant.",
    "fenrir": "Official character site showsLQ84i/BladeWolf only, not stockFenrir. Fenrir-named KONAMI card improves identification but does not provide whole-body/opposite-side neutral geometry. No Fenrir art generated."
  },
